    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mistaken Tones – 2",
      "",
      "One day, a woman got on an air conditioned public bus, and paid 1 yuan.",
      "",
      "Because air conditioned buses cost 1 yuan more than regular buses, the driver told the woman: “Two yuan!”",
      "",
      "But the woman instead heard “cool”, so she replied: “Yes! Air conditioned buses are very pleasant and cool!”",
      "",
      "The driver said again: “Pay two yuan!”",
      "The woman laughed and answered: “Not only my head is cool, my entire body is cool!”",
      "After saying this, she started to walk towards the back of the bus.",
      "",
      "The driver hurriedly said: “I’m saying that you should pay two yuan!”",
      "",
      "The woman turned her head and asked: “It’s cooler in the front? I think the back is cooler with less people!”",
      "",
      "The driver got so angry he couldn’t speak, and everyone on the bus laughed so hard they couldn’t speak.",
      ""
    ]
  }
